# The gitignore FENCE — a private-working repo holds material that must never leave this
# machine even though the repo itself is private (drafts, unpublished pricing, raw corpus
# samples). Name the fenced paths here explicitly per repo; this line is the marker that a
# fence exists, not the fence itself.
